---
export const prerender = true;
// FAQ Accordion com interatividade
---

<section class="py-24 px-6 bg-zinc-950">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h2
                class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4 bg-linear-to-b from-white to-zinc-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
            >
                Perguntas Frequentes
            </h2>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-lg">Tudo que você precisa saber</p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Items -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
            <!-- FAQ 1 -->
            <details
                class="group bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-violet-500/50 transition-all"
            >
                <summary
                    class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none"
                >
                    <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white"
                        >Como funciona o período de teste?</span
                    >
                    <svg
                        class="size-5 text-zinc-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    >
                        <path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Você tem 14 dias para testar todas as funcionalidades
                    gratuitamente. Não é necessário cartão de crédito e você
                    pode cancelar a qualquer momento.
                </div>
            </details>

            <!-- FAQ 2 -->
            <details
                class="group bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-violet-500/50 transition-all"
            >
                <summary
                    class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none"
                >
                    <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white"
                        >Posso mudar de plano depois?</span
                    >
                    <svg
                        class="size-5 text-zinc-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    >
                        <path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Sim! Você pode fazer upgrade ou downgrade do seu plano a
                    qualquer momento. As mudanças são aplicadas imediatamente e
                    o valor é ajustado proporcionalmente.
                </div>
            </details>

            <!-- FAQ 3 -->
            <details
                class="group bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-violet-500/50 transition-all"
            >
                <summary
                    class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none"
                >
                    <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white"
                        >Quais formas de pagamento são aceitas?</span
                    >
                    <svg
                        class="size-5 text-zinc-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    >
                        <path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Aceitamos cartões de crédito (Visa, Mastercard, Amex),
                    PayPal, transferência bancária e PIX para clientes no
                    Brasil.
                </div>
            </details>

            <!-- FAQ 4 -->
            <details
                class="group bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-violet-500/50 transition-all"
            >
                <summary
                    class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer list-none"
                >
                    <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white"
                        >Há garantia de reembolso?</span
                    >
                    <svg
                        class="size-5 text-zinc-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    >
                        <path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Sim! Oferecemos garantia de reembolso de 30 dias. Se não
                    estiver satisfeito, devolvemos 100% do seu dinheiro, sem
                    perguntas.
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact CTA -->
        <div class="mt-12 text-center">
            <p class="text-zinc-500 mb-4">Ainda tem dúvidas?</p>
            <button
                class="px-6 py-3 bg-violet-600 hover:bg-violet-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl transition-all hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(139,92,246,0.5)]"
            >
                Falar com Suporte
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
